伤的眼睛看。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必ず</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かならず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">一定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">必</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼女</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かのじょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">她；女朋友；女友</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79807\"><ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るかどうかである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问题是她到底来还是不来。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/395681\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">壁</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かべ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">墙；隔墙；障碍；阻碍；困难；壁宿（二十八宿之一）；（围棋）厚壁；棋墙（连成墙状的棋子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83448\"><ruby>壁<rp>(</rp><rt>かべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はぬりかえなければなりませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">墙壁应该干净吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">かまう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">介意；在意；关心；成为问题；要紧；造成不便；陪伴；照料；照看；款待；干涉；干预；介入；逗弄；戏弄；驱逐；禁止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201640\">どうか<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にかまわないでください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请不要太在意我。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2393888\" title=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">髪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">头发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125930\"><ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>髪<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした<ruby>女<rp>(</rp><rt>おんな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我遇到了一个长头发的女孩。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">噛む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咬；咀嚼；啃；（台词）念错；口误；磕巴；冲击；拍打；啮合；咬合；牵涉；涉及；说服；劝服</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226227\"><ruby>噛<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むと<ruby>痛<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">咬伤会疼吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">往来于；在...之间来回；来回奔走；去；上；出入；定期前往；流通；传导；传播；相似；相像</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195758\">マイクはバスで<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>かよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">米克乘坐公交车前往学校。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">他；男友；男朋友</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75797\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のスイングは<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>見事<rp>(</rp><rt>みごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的Swing真的很棒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼ら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かれら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">他们；她们；它们</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96434\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>二度<rp>(</rp><rt>にど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うことはなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们再也不会见过。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干；变干；干燥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212788\">そのぬれたシャツはすぐに<ruby>乾<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这件干燥的衬衫很快就会干燥。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代わり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">代替品；替代品；代替；替身；代理人；副手；接班人；代价；交换；回报；再来一份；续杯；加量；接下来的节目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208274\">その<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりにトランプをしようよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">换句话说,我们要做特朗普。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">変わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">改变；转变；变化；搬迁；移居；不同寻常；与众不同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">考える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんがえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">思考；思量；思索；沉思；反思；冥想；考虑；顾及；体谅；纳入考量；认为；相信；持有