"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ガソリン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">汽油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221414\">この<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあまりガソリンを<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这辆车不吃太多的燃料。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ガソリンスタンド</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">加油站</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219882\">この<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にガソリンスタンドはありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这里有加油站吗?</span></div></li>"]